.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK PROJECT CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik project create \- Create a project (Organization administrators only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik project create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a project (Organization administrators only)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
Project name
.TP
.B --key
Project key (defaults to the server's canonical suggestion from the name)
.TP
.B --description
Description text
.TP
.B --description-file
Description source (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --description-editor
Author the description in $VISUAL/$EDITOR instead of passing text
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --color
Display color as a hex string (e.g. #3b82f6)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
